    colors: one bar uses RED (2), the other AZURE (8) [observed]; h_bar is RED, v_bar is AZURE [observed]
    no_overlap: the h_bar row must not be in the v_bar row range, and the v_bar col must not be in the h_bar col range
    crossing_cell: cell at (h_row, v_col) is background in input
